   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNESCOSecondment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment (Christina Dahlman) to Unesco Paris within the area of Media and Communication/Unesco Assistance Programme to Independent Media in Conflict Areas during 2002-2004. The purpose for the secondment with Unesco is that Sida finds it valuable to improve the joint knowledge between Unesco and Sida within the areas of Media and Armed Conflict and serve as a base for further collaboration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering (Christina Dahlman) till Unesco Paris inom samarbets- omr&#xe5;det Medier och Kommunikation (Unesco Assistance Programme to Independent Media in Conflict Areas) under 2002-2004. Syftet med sekonderingen &#xe4;r att Sida anser det angel&#xe4;get att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den gemensamma kunskapen mellan Unesco och Sida inom omr&#xe5;det Media och Bev&#xe4;pnade Konflikter samt tj&#xe4;na som en bas f&#xf6;r fortsatt samarbete.</narrative>
  </description>
